@direction LR
@spacing 60

[List Every Funnel and Automation Currently Spending Money or Time] -> [Map Where Each Lead Enters and What It Should Be Worth]
[Map Where Each Lead Enters and What It Should Be Worth] -> [Trace Exactly Where Leads Drop Off or Stall]
[Trace Exactly Where Leads Drop Off or Stall] -> [Flag Steps Burning Ad Spend or Tool Cost With No Return]
[Flag Steps Burning Ad Spend or Tool Cost With No Return] -> [Put a Dollar Number on Every Leak: Lost Leads x Close Rate x Deal Value]
[Put a Dollar Number on Every Leak: Lost Leads x Close Rate x Deal Value] -> [Rank Every Leak by Revenue Impact, Highest Cost First]
[Rank Every Leak by Revenue Impact, Highest Cost First] -> [Fix the Highest-ROI Leak First, Not the Easiest One]
[Fix the Highest-ROI Leak First, Not the Easiest One] -> [Adjust the Funnel to Close Where the Money Was Leaking]
[Adjust the Funnel to Close Where the Money Was Leaking] -> [Re-Measure Conversion Rate and Cost Per Lead After the Fix]
[Re-Measure Conversion Rate and Cost Per Lead After the Fix] -> [Report the Dollar Impact, Not Just What Changed]
